{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_030DC0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"马那瓜地震发生在两年前，第二天就是平安夜。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"JPN_NEXT_DAY_CHRISTMAS_EVE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"城里裂开了好几条地缝。熟睡中的孩子来不及逃，就被倒塌的房屋压死了。在圣诞老人到来之前。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":"JPN_TRAGIC_SEQUENCE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"都怪索摩查，连老房子都没能好好翻建……简直是噩梦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"AUX_CAUSALITY_TONE_CORRECTED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"听说是直下型地震。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":"AUX_EPICENTER_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN_TERM"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"直到现在，断层正上方仍然很危险，连房子都不能建。市中心至今还是一片废墟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"而且重建资金还被索摩查侵吞了，是吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"JPN_CONFIRMING_TONE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"为了那些死去的人，我们绝不能输。一定要打倒索摩查。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""}]}